    {
      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"../RedisConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConfiguration</code></a> based on a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>URI</code></a> according to the following:\n\nIf <code>redisUri</code> contains sentinels, a <a href=\"../RedisSentinelConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisSentinelConfiguration</code></a> is returned\nIf <code>redisUri</code> has a configured socket a <a href=\"../RedisSocketConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisSocketConfiguration</code></a> is returned\nOtherwise a <a href=\"../RedisStandaloneConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStandaloneConfiguration</code></a> is returned",
      "translation": "根据给定的<a href=\"../RedisConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConfiguration</code></a>接口，基于<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>URI</code></a>创建配置：\n\n如果<code>redisUri</code>包含哨兵（sentinels），则返回一个<a href=\"../RedisSentinelConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisSentinelConfiguration</code></a>；\n如果<code>redisUri</code>已配置套接字，则返回一个<a href=\"../RedisSocketConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisSocketConfiguration</code></a>；\n否则，返回一个<a href=\"../RedisStandaloneConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStandaloneConfiguration</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"../RedisConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConfiguration</code></a> based on a <code>RedisURI</code> according to the following:\n\nIf <code>RedisURI</code> contains sentinels, a <a href=\"../RedisSentinelConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisSentinelConfiguration</code></a> is returned\nIf <code>RedisURI</code> has a configured socket a <a href=\"../RedisSocketConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisSocketConfiguration</code></a> is returned\nOtherwise a <a href=\"../RedisStandaloneConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStandaloneConfiguration</code></a> is returned",
      "translation": "根据以下规则，基于 <code>RedisURI</code> 创建 <a href=\"../RedisConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConfiguration</code></a>：\n\n如果 <code>RedisURI</code> 包含哨兵（sentinels），则返回一个 <a href=\"../RedisSentinelConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisSentinelConfiguration</code></a>；\n如果 <code>RedisURI</code> 配置了套接字，则返回一个 <a href=\"../RedisSocketConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisSocketConfiguration</code></a>；\n否则，返回一个 <a href=\"../RedisStandaloneConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStandaloneConfiguration</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"../RedisConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>Configuration</code></a> class used to set up a <a href=\"../RedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnection</code></a> with\n<a href=\"../RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> for connecting to <a href=\"https://redis.io/topics/sentinel\">Redis Sentinel(s)</a>.",
      "translation": "用于通过<a href=\"../RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a>配置与<a href=\"https://redis.io/topics/sentinel\">Redis Sentinel(s)</a>连接的<a href=\"../RedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnection</code></a>的<a href=\"../RedisConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>Configuration</code></a>类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Constructs a new <a href=\"../lettuce/LettuceConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.lettuce\"><code>LettuceConnectionFactory</code></a> instance using the given\n<a href=\"../RedisStaticMasterReplicaConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStaticMasterReplicaConfiguration</code></a> and <a href=\"../lettuce/LettuceClientConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.lettuce\"><code>LettuceClientConfiguration</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"../RedisStaticMasterReplicaConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisStaticMasterReplicaConfiguration</code></a>和<a href=\"../lettuce/LettuceClientConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.lettuce\"><code>LettuceClientConfiguration</code></a>构建一个新的<a href=\"../lettuce/LettuceConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection.lettuce\"><code>LettuceConnectionFactory</code></a>实例。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configuration class used to set up a <a href=\"../RedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnection</code></a> via <a href=\"../RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> for connecting to\n<a href=\"https://redis.io/topics/cluster-spec\">Redis Cluster</a>.",
