    {
      "source": "Configuration class used for setting up <a href=\"../RedisConnection.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnection</code></a> via <a href=\"../RedisConnectionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>RedisConnectionFactory</code></a> connecting to\nsingle <a href=\"https://redis.io/\">Redis</a> using a local unix domain socket.",
